---
title: Rolled Butter Cookies
author: Mary Arntson
category: Cookies
cook time: 5-8 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sifted flour{3%cups}
@baking powder{1.5%tsp}
@soft butter{1%cup}
@cream{3%Tbsp}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@sugar{1%cup}
@slightly beaten egg{1}
@vanilla{1%tsp}

Cream sugar, butter, egg, cream and vanilla. Sift in dry ingredients. Roll out to 1/8 inch thickness and cut as desired. Bake at 400 degrees for 5-8 minutes. Cool before decorating.
